  "description": "RIWQAR crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C25 H37 Ho4 N7 O27,2(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Ho1 (Ho) has 9 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho3 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho4 (Ho) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.569-5.007 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 89.30-178.26°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C27H45Ho4N7O29. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 4 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 1 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
